{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2021-08-24 09:05:00', 'title': "PPG FOUNDATION AWARDS $170,000 IN SCHOLARSHIPS TO ACCELERATE STUDENTS' ACADEMIC STUDIES", 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE: PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE PPG FOUNDATION IS PROVIDING MORE THAN $170,000 IN UNDERGRADUATE COLLEGE SCHOLARSHIPS THROUGH THE NATIONAL MERIT® SCHOLARSHIP CORPORATION (NMSC). THE PPG FOUNDATION HAS AWARDED MORE THAN 3,000 SCHOLARSHIPS TO HELP U.S. STUDENTS ACCELERATE THEIR UNDERGRADUATE STUDIES AND CAREER OPPORTUNITIES SINCE ESTABLISHING THE PPG FOUNDATION SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM IN 1956. FROM ASPIRING ENGINEERS TO PHYSICIANS, THE 2021 SCHOLARSHIPS INCLUDE 29'}